 예를 들면 프로그래밍에 사용한 컴퓨터 언어에 따라 수행","words":[{"text":"시용한","x":195,"y":2028,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"소프트웨어","x":293,"y":2028,"width":140,"height":32},{"text":"환경도","x":448,"y":2028,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"중요하다.","x":547,"y":2029,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"예를","x":687,"y":2029,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"들면","x":756,"y":2029,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"프로그래밍에","x":826,"y":2028,"width":172,"height":33},{"text":"사용한","x":1012,"y":2028,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1113,"y":2028,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"언어에","x":1214,"y":2028,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"따라","x":1313,"y":2028,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"수행","x":1383,"y":2027,"width":57,"height":32}]},{"text":"속도가 달라질 수 있다. 즉 일반적인 경우, C와 같은 컴파일 언어를 사용한 경우가 베이직과 같","words":[{"text":"속도가","x":195,"y":2083,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"달라질","x":293,"y":2083,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":389,"y":2083,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"있다.","x":432,"y":2082,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"즉","x":509,"y":2084,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"일반적인","x":552,"y":2082,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"경우,","x":679,"y":2084,"width":63,"height":31},{"text":"C와","x":758,"y":2083,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"같은","x":818,"y":2083,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"컴파일","x":888,"y":2082,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"언어를","x":987,"y":2083,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"사용한","x":1083,"y":2082,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"경우가","x":1184,"y":2082,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"베이직과","x":1284,"y":2082,"width":118,"height":32},{"text":"같","x":1413,"y":2081,"width":30,"height":31}]},{"text":"은 인터프리트 언어를 사우한 경우보다 빠른 수행을 보인다. 또한 실험에 시용했던 데이터가 아","words":[{"text":"은","x":194,"y":2138,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"인터프리트","x":237,"y":2137,"width":141,"height":32},{"text":"언어를","x":391,"y":2137,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"사우한","x":486,"y":2137,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"경우보다","x":586,"y":2137,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"빠른","x":712,"y":2137,"width